{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathbound\u2013 A sci-fi sandbox blending survival-building and epic battles. On oxygen-deprived alien wastelands, survivors rebuild civilization while fighting enraged &quot;Star Dragons&quot; spawned by ecological collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a 3-4 hour planetary pioneering journey to uncover the truth of the alien world. The demo includes the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction &amp; Customization: Freely build your planetary home (modular construction of foundations, walls, and roofs) and freely cultivate plants from the planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Planet Exploration: 20+ planetary creatures, 10+ interactive plants, open-world map, rideable star dragons hatched from dragon eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-weapon Combat System: The demo includes four combat weapons, each with unique skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival &amp; Collection: Diverse weather systems, collect spacecraft wreckage and energy cores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented Narrative: Collect crew log entries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Demo vs Full: Evolution Journey]\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \u200b<strong>\u200bFull Story:\u200b</strong>\u200b Unravel world mysteries, experience an epic narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \u200b<strong>\u200bEnhanced Mechanics:\u200b</strong>\u200b Unlock deeper combat &amp; progression systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \u200b<strong>\u200bUltimate Challenge:\u200b</strong>\u200b Conquer jaw-dropping boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \u200b<strong>\u200bOpen Zones:\u200b</strong>\u200b Explore vast seamless worlds, uncover secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \u200b<strong>\u200bComplete Arsenal:\u200b</strong>\u200b Acquire powerfu